{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../exported-story-link/", "title": "ExportedStoryLink"}, "next": {"link": "../file-hash/", "title": "FileHash"}, "title": "FactCheck", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"factcheck\">\n<h1>FactCheck<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#factcheck\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.FactCheck\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FactCheck</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.FactCheck\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/fact-check/#pyrogram.raw.base.FactCheck\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.FactCheck\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">FactCheck</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">B89BFCCF</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>hash</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">64-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>need_check</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>country</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>text</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/text-with-entities/#pyrogram.raw.base.TextWithEntities\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.TextWithEntities\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TextWithEntities</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt>Functions:</dt><dd><p>This object can be returned by 1 function.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../functions/messages/get-fact-check/#pyrogram.raw.functions.messages.GetFactCheck\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.functions.messages.GetFactCheck\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">messages.GetFactCheck</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API function.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["telegram/types/file-hash", "FileHash", "N", "next"], ["telegram/types/exported-story-link", "ExportedStoryLink", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">FactCheck</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.FactCheck\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">FactCheck</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "telegram/types/fact-check", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigati